preConditionHook:
// EL: ovNow  = (minlist(h, h[1]) - maxlist(l, l[1])) / (h[1] - l[1] + epsilon);
//     ovThen = the same reading lagBars bars ago.
// MinList/MaxList are ACCEPTED for tick-grid PRICE operands only
// (EL_FEATURES.md): these operands are bar extremes, so they differ by
// exactly 0 or by at least one tick -- 1e9-1e11x the relational tolerance --
// and whichever comparison the reserved word carries cannot matter. The
// plain ternary stand-in is therefore exact, the same arrangement
// TwoBarRangePosition and AtrProfitTarget use. (<algorithm> is not among
// the emitted includes, so no std::min/std::max.)
// The epsilon guards a zero-range reference bar: EL raises a runtime
// divide-by-zero error on a zero denominator (EL_FEATURES.md), so it is an
// input rather than a nicety.
ovNow = ((high[0] < high[1] ? high[0] : high[1])
         - (low[0] > low[1] ? low[0] : low[1]))
        / (high[1] - low[1] + epsilon);
ovThen = ((high[lagBars] < high[lagBars + 1] ? high[lagBars] : high[lagBars + 1])
          - (low[lagBars] > low[lagBars + 1] ? low[lagBars] : low[lagBars + 1]))
         / (high[lagBars + 1] - low[lagBars + 1] + epsilon);
